<title>USA: Reliance in alliance with China's Huatai.</title>
<headline>Reliance in alliance with China's Huatai.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Group Holdings Inc said on Thursday it signed a letter of intent with Huatai Property Insurance Co to cooperate in product development and underwriting and reinsurance of property and casualty risks in China.</p>
<p>The company's Reliance National unit would provide Huatai with personnel training, technical assistance and other support, Reliance said in a news release.</p>
<p>Reliance said it expects to be in a position to reinsure &quot;a substantial portion&quot; of jointly developed products underwritten by Huatai.</p>
</text>
